  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Museums for Peace</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The current project builds on the will of UNESCO and the People&apos;s Republic of China to collaborate in promoting museums for sustainable development and intercultural dialogue, notably in view of the recently adopted new global Recommendation on Museums and Collections, the first standard-setting instrument in this domain since 1960. Taking note of the increasingly complex role of museums in the contemporary world, and using the Chinese museum field as an example, the objective of the project is to guide museums in facing new challenges that have emerged over the last four decades.</narrative>
  </description>
